IX>1. Is there any way to polymorph on demand, or is it just random?

Find a wand of polymorph and zap it at yourself (direction '.').

IX>   Is there any way, other than walking around without armor on,
IX>   to prevent the armor that I wear as a human from getting wrecked
IX>   when I poly?

Don't wear a ring of polymorph - use the wand instead.

Or, find a dragon scale mail; that way you'll always polymorph into the
particular type of dragon. I suggest (wording as needed in a wish):
blessed +3 gray dragon scale mail

IX>2. What is good to polymorph into?

dragons (gray, black, red)
master lich

IX>4. Is there any way to bless items other than dipping them in holy water,
IX>   which seems to use up the holy water?  How can I generate new potions
IX>   of water/holy water?

You can turn a potion of water into holy water by dropping it on a
lawful altar. You can get a potion of water by #dipping a unicorn horn
into a harmful potion (sickness, booze, etc.)

